 <h3><a href="../../plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/antigravity-start-hint.mjs">plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/antigravity-start-hint.mjs ↗</a></h3>
-<p>Only in a governed, Git-initialized workspace, writes a private per-session bootstrap lock using the same validated native identity that the Antigravity pretool guard reads, including `conversationId`. Invalid or path-shaped identities cannot arm a lock or form filesystem paths; an ungoverned or uninitialized workspace receives only an onboarding hint.</p>
+<p>Only in a governed, Git-initialized workspace, writes a private per-session bootstrap lock using the same validated native identity that the Antigravity pretool guard reads, including `conversationId`. Invalid or path-shaped identities cannot arm a lock or form filesystem paths; an ungoverned or uninitialized workspace receives only an onboarding hint. Also names the flat dispatch request, the host&#39;s branch refusal and the exact recovery read, and keeps the answered intake values and material input on later turns.</p>
