-<p>Resolves Agy&#39;s native session identity from the hook payload, without borrowing an inherited Codex environment ID, and refuses implementation tools while that session&#39;s private bootstrap lock is present. Passive reads remain available for recovery.</p>
+<p>Resolves Agy&#39;s native session identity from the hook payload, without borrowing an inherited Codex environment ID, and refuses implementation tools while that session&#39;s private bootstrap lock is present. Passive reads remain available for recovery. Also reads a child&#39;s commit message file from its own worktree, records the closing conversation for the close, issues the Critic Source return from the child&#39;s final message and keeps the generated Critic prompt lines inside the Contamination Rule.</p>
