 <h3><a href="../../plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/guard-lifecycle-ready.mjs">plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/guard-lifecycle-ready.mjs ↗</a></h3>
-<p>Enforces the implementation-phase transition after session readiness: the active plan&#39;s scoped adoption disposition and planning fitness are checked separately. A valid deferral does not manufacture a physical map or a fitness PASS; a missing navigation index reaches the real evaluator as a blocking finding unless a governed exception applies.</p>
+<p>Enforces the implementation-phase transition after session readiness: the active plan&#39;s scoped adoption disposition and planning fitness are checked separately. A valid deferral does not manufacture a physical map or a fitness PASS; a missing navigation index reaches the real evaluator as a blocking finding unless a governed exception applies. Installs the hook authority trace only when the hook is the process entrypoint; the dispatch hooks emit the trace themselves.</p>
